      "content": "To cut costs by half, we need to optimize the compute cycles during the analysis phase. I recommend implementing aggressive caching strategies for build artifacts and container images to reduce redundant processing. Furthermore, we should investigate rightsizing the agent instances, perhaps moving to burstable instances or smaller VM types if the processing load allows. These changes should provide a significant reduction in your AWS bill within the week.",
